<item><title>NCBA Bank and MTN MoMo launch USh140m MoKash rewards campaign</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/ncba-bank-and-mtn-momo-launch-ush140m-mokash-rewards-f1aa74/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/ncba-bank-and-mtn-momo-launch-ush140m-mokash-rewards-f1aa74/</guid><category>Uganda</category><description>The 12-week promotion rewards customers for loan repayments, savings balances and clearing eligible debts, running through February 16, 2027.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 09:00:50 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" length="32020" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Uganda lenders urged to address USh31.4 trillion small-business gap</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-lenders-urged-to-address-ush31-4-trillion-small-2c506d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-lenders-urged-to-address-ush31-4-trillion-small-2c506d/</guid><category>Uganda</category><description>At a Kampala meeting, financial institutions were asked to connect available investment capital with businesses that struggle to qualify for formal loans.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 07:00:12 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" length="32020" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
